            "html": "<section data-stage=\"snih\" class=\"sec hero hero-sub\">\n<div class=\"hero-text\">\n<h1 class=\"h1 rise\">Osm kusů brokátu: <span class=\"nw\">čchi-kung</span> pro zdraví</h1>\n<p class=\"lead rise d1\">Je to velmi jednoduché a velmi účinné cvičení, prospěšné pro zdraví.</p>\n\n<div class=\"actions rise d3\"><a href=\"/kurzy-a-lekce/#kurz-brokat\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Rozvrh a ceny <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arr\"><path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#cviky\" class=\"more\">Názvy jednotlivých brokátů <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arr\"><path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</section>"
